@startuml
left to right direction
skinparam packageStyle rectangle

actor "Player" as Player
actor "Developer / Admin" as Dev
actor "Ad Network (AdMob)" as AdNet
actor "Payment Gateway (Google Play Billing / Apple App Store)" as PayGate

rectangle "Rabit_doku Mobile App" {
  usecase "View Stage Map (Candy Crush Style)" as UC1
  usecase "Select & Play a Stage" as UC2
  usecase "Place / Remove Rabbit on Grid" as UC3
  usecase "Use Hint (Booster)" as UC4
  usecase "Buy Booster with Real Money (IAP)" as UC5
  usecase "Watch Rewarded Ad for Booster" as UC6
  usecase "View Interstitial / Banner Ad" as UC7
  usecase "Receive Daily Stage Release (Remote Config)" as UC8
  usecase "Unlock Next Stage" as UC9
  usecase "Save Game Progress (Stars, Hearts, Boosters)" as UC10
  usecase "Remove Ads (One-time IAP)" as UC11
}

Player --> UC1 : browses
Player --> UC2 : taps stage node
Player --> UC3 : plays puzzle
Player --> UC4 : spends booster
Player --> UC5 : pays real money
Player --> UC6 : watches ad
Player --> UC7 : views ad
Player --> UC9 : completes stage
Player --> UC11 : purchases

Dev --> UC8 : publishes daily stage pack
AdNet --> UC6 : serves rewarded video
AdNet --> UC7 : serves interstitial / banner
PayGate --> UC5 : processes payment
PayGate --> UC11 : processes payment

UC2 ..> UC3 : starts
UC3 ..> UC9 : on win/lose
UC5 ..> UC4 : grants booster
UC6 ..> UC4 : grants booster
UC9 ..> UC10 : saves progress
UC10 ..> UC2 : updates map state
@enduml